ลาดริมน้ำตะกั่วป่า"><a class="place-image" href="/en/places/riverwalk/"><img src="/assets/riverwalk.webp" alt="ตลาดริมน้ำตะกั่วป่า" width="1000" height="1000" loading="lazy"><span class="card-index">14</span><span class="image-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="card-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Markets & Food</span><h3><a href="/en/places/riverwalk/">Takuapa Riverwalk</a></h3><p>Food and life by the river</p></div></article><article class="place-card" data-place-card data-category="market" data-name="ถนนสายวัฒนธรรมเมืองเก่าตะกั่วป่า"><a class="place-image" href="/en/places/culture-street/"><img src="/assets/culture-street.webp" alt="ถนนสายวัฒนธรรมเมืองเก่าตะกั่วป่า" width="1000" height="1000" loading="lazy"><span class="card-index">15</span><span class="image-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="card-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Markets & Food</span><h3><a href="/en/places/culture-street/">Takua Pa Old Town Cultural Street</a></h3><p>Walking and reading the city through buildings and people</p></div></article><article class="place-card" data-place-card data-category="market" data-name="ศูนย์อาหารลานโล่งตะกั่วป่า"><a class="place-image" href="/en/places/food-center/"><img src="/assets/food-center.webp" alt="ศูนย์อาหารลานโล่งตะกั่วป่า" width="1000" height="1000" loading="lazy"><span class="card-index">20</span><span class="image-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="card-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Markets & Food</span><h3><a href="/en/places/food-center/">Takua Pa Open-Air Food Center</a></h3><p>Many flavors in one destination</p></div></article><article class="place-card" data-place-card data-category="museum" data-name="พิพิธภัณฑ์เสนานุชรังสรรค์ชุมชนตะกั่วป่า"><a class="place-image" href="/en/places/museum/"><img src="/assets/museum.webp" alt="พิพิธภัณฑ์เสนานุชรังสรรค์ชุมชนตะกั่วป่า" width="1000" height="1000" loading="lazy"><span class="card-index">07</span><span class="image-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="card-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Museums</span><h3><a href="/en/places/museum/">Takua Pa Community Museum</a></h3><p>Preserving the town's stories together</p></div></article></div><div class="empty-state" data-place-empty hidden><h3>Haven't found this destination yet</h3><p>Try another search term or view all places</p><button type="button" data-clear-places>Clear filters</button></div></div><a class="text-link index-link" href="/en/places/">Open index and search places ↗</a></section><section class="section traditions-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="chapter">04 / Read the town</span><h2>When the city has an appointment</h2></div><p>Year-round traditions · Timing from the source documents</p></div><div class="traditions-list"><details class="tradition"><summary><span class="event-no">01</span><span class="event-name">New Year's Dawn Almsgiving</span><span class="event-period">January 1</span><span class="expand-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div class="event-body"><p>Activities in the traditions section of the municipal brochure</p><a class="text-link" href="/en/traditions/new-year-alms/">Read details from document ↗</a></div></details><details class="tradition"><summary><span class="event-no">02</span><span class="event-name">Takua Pa Governor Worship Ceremony</span><span class="event-period">February</span><span class="expand-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div class="event-body"><p>Related places: <a href="/en/places/governor-wall/">Governor’s Residence Wall</a></p><a class="text-link" href="/en/traditions/ruler-ceremony/">Read details from document ↗</a></div></details><details class="tradition"><summary><span class="event-no">03</span><span class="event-name">Relic Procession to Khao Phra Bat</span><span class="event-period">Makha Bucha Day</span><span class="expand-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div class="event-body"><p>Related places: <a href="/en/places/wat-boromthat/">Wat Boromthat Khiri Khet (the town's relic temple)</a></p><a class="text-link" href="/en/traditions/relic-procession/">Read details from document ↗</a></div></details><details class="tradition"><summary><span class="event-no">04</span><span class="event-name">Phra Narai and Deities Worship Ceremony</span><span class="event-period">March - April</span><span class="expand-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div class="event-body"><p>Related places: <a href="/en/places/phra-narai/">Phra Narai Park</a></p><a class="text-link" href="/en/traditions/narai-ceremony/">Read details from document ↗</a></div></details><details class="tradition"><summary><span class="event-no">05</span><span class="event-name">Vegetarian Festival (Jia Kiu Ong Chai)</span><span class="event-period">1st to 9th day of the 9th Chinese lunar month · Usually September-October</span><span class="expand-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div class="event-body"><p>Related places: <a href="/en/places/guan-yu/">Guan Yu / Sin Chai Tung Shrine</a> · <a href="/en/places/pun-thao/">Pun Thao Kong A Shrine</a> · <a href="/en/places/kue-chai/">Kue Chai Tung Shrine</a> · <a href="/en/places/rong-jae/">The Shrine in the Garden</a></p><a class="text-link" href="/en/traditions/vegetarian/">Read details from document ↗</a></div></details><details class="tradition"><summary><span class="event-no">06</span><span class="event-name">Chak Phra Festival</span><span class="event-period">Day after Buddhist Lent ends</span><span class="expand-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div class="event-body"><p>Related places: <a href="/en/places/wat-boromthat/">Wat Boromthat Khiri Khet (the town's relic temple)</a> · <a href="/en/places/wat-khuha/">Wat Khuha Phimuk (the cave hill temple)</a> · <a href="/en/places/wat-pathum/">Wat Pathum Thara (the front town temple)</a> · <a href="/en/places/wat-kongkha/">Wat Kongkha Phimuk (the riverside temple)</a> · <a href="/en/places/wat-nikorn/">Wat Nikornwararam</a> · <a href="/en/places/wat-sena/">Wat Sena Nuch Rangsan</a></p><a class="text-link" href="/en/traditions/chak-phra/">Read details from document ↗</a></div></details><details class="tradition"><summary><span class="event-no">07</span><span class="event-name">Loy Krathong</span><span class="event-period">Full moon of the 12th Thai lunar month · Document mentions November</span><span class="expand-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div class="event-body"><p>Related places: <a href="/en/places/riverwalk/">Takuapa Riverwalk</a></p><a class="text-link" href="/en/traditions/loy-krathong/">Read details from document ↗</a></div></details></div><p class="small">Check each year’s schedule before travelling</p></section><section class="food-feature"><div class="food-feature-image"><img src="/assets/food-center.webp" alt="ศูนย์อาหารลานโล่งตะกั่วป่า" width="1000" height="1000" loading="lazy"><span class="food-stamp">LOCAL<br>FLAVOURS</span></div><div class="food-feature-copy"><span class="chapter">05 / Eat and shop for souvenirs in the district</span><h2>Know the city<br>Through another flavor</h2><p>Open the list of restaurants, drinks, and souvenirs<br>59 shops from municipal brochure</p><div class="food-counts"><span><b>32</b>Food</span><span><b>20</b>Drinks</span><span><b>08</b>Souvenirs</span></div><a class="button" href="/en/eat/">Find shops<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section><section class="about-strip"><span class="chapter">Notes from Baan Siwara</span><h2>The town’s story<br>That we want to invite you to know</h2><div><p>Takua Pa 101 compiles information from the Takua Pa municipal brochure, with sources and data scope for you to read further</p><a class="text-link" href="/en/about/">Get to know this guide ↗</a></div></section></main><footer class="site-footer"><div class="footer-top"><a href="/en/" class="footer-name">Takua Pa <em>101</em></a><p>One city<br>Stories to get to know</p><a class="round-link" href="#main" aria-label="กลับขึ้นด้านบน">↑</a></div><div class="footer-bottom"><a href="https://siwaracafe.com/">Created by Baan Siwara, Takua Pa</a><span>Old Town Guide · Phang Nga Province</span><a href="https://www.takuapacity.go.th/pdf/travel-preview.pdf">Original Brochure ↗</a></div></footer><nav class="tabbar" aria-label="เมนูด่วน"><a href="/en/" aria-current="page"><span class="tb-glyph" aria-hidden="true">⌂</span>Home</a><a href="/en/map/"><span class="tb-glyph" aria-hidden="true">◈</span>Map</a><a href="/en/eat/"><span class="tb-glyph" aria-hidden="true">◉</span>Eat</a><a href="/en/trip/"><span class="tb-glyph" aria-hidden="true">◫</span>Trip<span class="qs-badge" data-trip-count hidden>0</span></a></nav></body></html>
