-index">01</span><span class="image-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="card-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Temples & Pagodas</span><h3><a href="/en/places/wat-boromthat/">Wat Boromthat Khiri Khet (the town's relic temple)</a></h3><p>White pagoda and the town's faith</p></div></article><article class="place-card" data-place-card data-category="temple" data-name="วัดคุหาภิมุข (วัดควนถ้ำ)"><a class="place-image" href="/en/places/wat-khuha/"><img src="/assets/wat-khuha.webp" alt="วัดคุหาภิมุข (วัดควนถ้ำ)" width="1000" height="1000" loading="lazy"><span class="card-index">02</span><span class="image-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="card-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Temples & Pagodas</span><h3><a href="/en/places/wat-khuha/">Wat Khuha Phimuk (the cave hill temple)</a></h3><p>Small details that invite you to pause and look.</p></div></article><article class="place-card" data-place-card data-category="temple" data-name="วัดปทุมธารา (วัดหน้าเมือง)"><a class="place-image" href="/en/places/wat-pathum/"><img src="/assets/wat-pathum.webp" alt="วัดปทุมธารา (วัดหน้าเมือง)" width="1000" height="1000" loading="lazy"><span class="card-index">03</span><span class="image-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="card-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Temples & Pagodas</span><h3><a href="/en/places/wat-pathum/">Wat Pathum Thara (the front town temple)</a></h3><p>Old ordination hall and waterway stories</p></div></article><article class="place-card" data-place-card data-category="temple" data-name="วัดคงคาภิมุข (วัดคงคา)"><a class="place-image" href="/en/places/wat-kongkha/"><img src="/assets/wat-kongkha.webp" alt="วัดคงคาภิมุข (วัดคงคา)" width="1000" height="1000" loading="lazy"><span class="card-index">04</span><span class="image-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="card-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Temples & Pagodas</span><h3><a href="/en/places/wat-kongkha/">Wat Kongkha Phimuk (the riverside temple)</a></h3><p>Southern Thai style ordination hall details</p></div></article><article class="place-card" data-place-card data-category="temple" data-name="วัดนิกรวราราม (วัดย่านยาว)"><a class="place-image" href="/en/places/wat-nikorn/"><img src="/assets/wat-nikorn.webp" alt="วัดนิกรวราราม (วัดย่านยาว)" width="1000" height="726" loading="lazy"><span class="card-index">05</span><span class="image-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="card-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Temples & Pagodas</span><h3><a href="/en/places/wat-nikorn/">Wat Nikornwararam</a></h3><p>The temple and community memories</p></div></article><article class="place-card" data-place-card data-category="temple" data-name="วัดเสนานุชรังสรรค์ (วัดใหม่)"><a class="place-image" href="/en/places/wat-sena/"><img src="/assets/wat-sena.webp" alt="วัดเสนานุชรังสรรค์ (วัดใหม่)" width="1000" height="1000" loading="lazy"><span class="card-index">06</span><span class="image-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="card-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Temples & Pagodas</span><h3><a href="/en/places/wat-sena/">Wat Sena Nuch Rangsan</a></h3><p>Thai and Chinese traces in the same building</p></div></article><article class="place-card" data-place-card data-category="shrine" data-name="ศาลเจ้าพ่อกวนอู ซิ่นไช่ตึ๋ง"><a class="place-image" href="/en/places/guan-yu/"><img src="/assets/guan-yu.webp" alt="ศาลเจ้าพ่อกวนอู ซิ่นไช่ตึ๋ง" width="1000" height="1000" loading="lazy"><span class="card-index">08</span><span class="image-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="card-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Shrines & Vegetarian Halls</span><h3><a href="/en/places/guan-yu/">Guan Yu / Sin Chai Tung Shrine</a></h3><p>Red door and the community's faith</p></div></article><article class="place-card" data-place-card data-category="shrine" data-name="ศาลเจ้าปุนเถ่ากงอ๊า"><a class="place-image" href="/en/places/pun-thao/"><img src="/assets/pun-thao.webp" alt="ศาลเจ้าปุนเถ่ากงอ๊า" width="1000" height="1000" loading="lazy"><span class="card-index">09</span><span class="image-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="card-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Shrines & Vegetarian Halls</span><h3><a href="/en/places/pun-thao/">Pun Thao Kong A Shrine</a></h3><p>Faith in the old port area</p></div></article><article class="place-card" data-place-card data-category="shrine" data-name="ศาลเจ้ากู่ใช่ตึ๋ง"><a class="place-image" href="/en/places/kue-chai/"><img src="/assets/kue-chai.webp" alt="ศาลเจ้ากู่ใช่ตึ๋ง" width="1000" height="1000" loading="lazy"><span class="card-index">10</span><span class="image-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="card-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Shrines & Vegetarian Halls</span><h3><a href="/en/places/kue-chai/">Kue Chai Tung Shrine</a></h3><p>A space for people's hopes</p></div></article><article class="place-card" data-place-card data-category="shrine" data-name="โรงเจในสวน"><a class="place-image" href="/en/places/rong-jae/"><img src="/assets/rong-jae.webp" alt="โรงเจในสวน" width="1000" height="1000" loading="lazy"><span class="card-index">11</span><span class="image-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="card-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Shrines & Vegetarian Halls</span><h3><a href="/en/places/rong-jae/">The Shrine in the Garden</a></h3><p>Traditions passed down through places</p></div></article><article class="place-card" data-place-card data-category="heritage" data-name="สะพานเหล็กบุญสูง"><a class="place-image" href="/en/places/iron-bridge/"><img src="/assets/iron-bridge.webp" alt="สะพานเหล็กบุญสูง" width="1000" height="1000" loading="lazy"><span class="card-index">16</span><span class="image-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="card-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Old Buildings & City Traces</span><h3><a href="/en/places/iron-bridge/">Boon Soong Iron Bridge</a></h3><p>Iron structure connecting mining stories</p></div></article><article class="place-card" data-place-card data-category="heritage" data-name="กำแพงจวนเจ้าเมืองตะกั่วป่า"><a class="place-image" href="/en/places/governor-wall/"><img src="/assets/governor-wall.webp" alt="กำแพงจวนเจ้าเมืองตะกั่วป่า" width="1000" height="1000" loading="lazy"><span class="card-index">17</span><span class="image-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="card-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Old Buildings & City Traces</span><h3><a href="/en/places/governor-wall/">Governor’s Residence Wall</a></h3><p>A trace on the wall that tells the town's story</p></div></article><article class="place-card" data-place-card data-category="heritage" data-name="บ้านขุนอินทร์"><a class="place-image" href="/en/places/khun-in/"><img src="/assets/khun-in.webp" alt="บ้านขุนอินทร์" width="1000" height="1000" loading="lazy"><span class="card-index">18</span><span class="image-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="card-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Old Buildings & City Traces</span><h3><a href="/en/places/khun-in/">Khun In House</a></h3><p>Windows and balconies inviting a look into the past</p></div></article><article class="place-card" data-place-card data-category="heritage" data-name="โรงเรียนเต้าหมิง"><a class="place-image" href="/en/places/tao-ming/"><img src="/assets/tao-ming.webp" alt="โรงเรียนเต้าหมิง" width="1000" height="667" loading="lazy"><span class="card-index">19</span><span class="image-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="card-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Old Buildings & City Traces</span><h3><a href="/en/places/tao-ming/">Tao Ming School</a></h3><p>A building that passes on language and culture</p></div></article><article class="place-card" data-place-card data-category="park" data-name="สวนสาธารณะพระนารายณ์"><a class="place-image" href="/en/places/phra-narai/"><img src="/assets/phra-narai.webp" alt="สวนสาธารณะพระนารายณ์" width="1000" height="1000" loading="lazy"><span class="card-index">12</span><span class="image-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="card-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Parks & Public Spaces</span><h3><a href="/en/places/phra-narai/">Phra Narai Park</a></h3><p>Rest area with stories of belief</p></div></article><article class="place-card" data-place-card data-category="park" data-name="สวนสาธารณะทุ่งพระโพธิ์"><a class="place-image" href="/en/places/thung-phra/"><img src="/assets/thung-phra.webp" alt="สวนสาธารณะทุ่งพระโพธิ์" width="1000" height="1000" loading="lazy"><span class="card-index">13</span><span class="image-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="card-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Parks & Public Spaces</span><h3><a href="/en/places/thung-phra/">Thung Phra Pho Park</a></h3><p>Steamboat traces in the garden</p></div></article><article class="place-card" data-place-card data-category="market" data-name="ตลาดริมน้ำตะกั่วป่า"><a class="place-image" href="/en/places/riverwalk/"><img src="/assets/riverwalk.webp" alt="ตลาดริมน้ำตะกั่วป่า" width="1000" height="1000" loading="lazy"><span class="card-index">14</span><span class="image-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="card-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Markets & Food</span><h3><a href="/en/places/riverwalk/">Takuapa Riverwalk</a></h3><p>Food and life by the river</p></div></article><article class="place-card" data-place-card data-category="market" data-name="ถนนสายวัฒนธรรมเมืองเก่าตะกั่วป่า"><a class="place-image" href="/en/places/culture-street/"><img src="/assets/culture-street.webp" alt="ถนนสายวัฒนธรรมเมืองเก่าตะกั่วป่า" width="1000" height="1000" loading="lazy"><span class="card-index">15</span><span class="image-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="card-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Markets & Food</span><h3><a href="/en/places/culture-street/">Takua Pa Old Town Cultural Street</a></h3><p>Walking and reading the city through buildings and people</p></div></article><article class="place-card" data-place-card data-category="market" data-name="ศูนย์อาหารลานโล่งตะกั่วป่า"><a class="place-image" href="/en/places/food-center/"><img src="/assets/food-center.webp" alt="ศูนย์อาหารลานโล่งตะกั่วป่า" width="1000" height="1000" loading="laz